{"id":"cff81e9634188222","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-filter-extension.md","title":"thm-filter-extension","display":"thm-filter-extension","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-filter]]"],"display":"thm-filter-extension","label":"93-thm-filter-extension","aliases":["93-thm-filter-extension"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9beeac4373d773f8\" href=\"?note=9beeac4373d773f8\" title=\"93-df-filter\">93-df-filter</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-filter-extension"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-filter-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-filter-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-filter-extension-thm-filter-extension\">thm-filter-extension <code>thm-filter-extension</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\">\\(\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\)</span> has carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathbf A|\">\\(|\\mathbf A|\\)</span> and a least element <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\ne|\\mathbf A|\">\\(F\\ne|\\mathbf A|\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}filter\\text{-}extension}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land0\\in|\\mathbf A|\n\\land\\forall a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(0\\leq_{\\mathbf A}a)\n\\land F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\land F\\ne|\\mathbf A|\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\;\\Bigl[\nF\\subseteq G\\land G\\ne|\\mathbf A|\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\\forall H\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n\\bigl(G\\subseteq H\\land H\\ne|\\mathbf A|\\to H=G\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}filter\\text{-}extension}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land0\\in|\\mathbf A|\n\\land\\forall a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(0\\leq_{\\mathbf A}a)\n\\land F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\land F\\ne|\\mathbf A|\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\;\\Bigl[\nF\\subseteq G\\land G\\ne|\\mathbf A|\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\\forall H\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n\\bigl(G\\subseteq H\\land H\\ne|\\mathbf A|\\to H=G\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The least element ensures that the union of a chain of proper filters remains proper: if the union contained <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>, one member of the chain would already be improper.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-filter-extension-thm-filter-extension","text":"thm-filter-extension `thm-filter-extension`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"9beeac4373d773f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-filter]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathbf A|","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"F\\ne|\\mathbf A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}filter\\text{-}extension}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land0\\in|\\mathbf A|\n\\land\\forall a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(0\\leq_{\\mathbf A}a)\n\\land F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\land F\\ne|\\mathbf A|\\\\\n&\\to\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\;\\Bigl[\nF\\subseteq G\\land G\\ne|\\mathbf A|\\\\\n&\\hspace{7em}\\land\\forall H\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n\\bigl(G\\subseteq H\\land H\\ne|\\mathbf A|\\to H=G\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":1037,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["9beeac4373d773f8"]}